summary: Use basic ELF utilities to analyse the vmcore from Kdump.
description: |
    It uses basic ELF utilites, readelf, objdump and eu-readelf to analyse
    the vmcore from Kdump.
contact: Kdump QE <kdump-qe-list@redhat.com>
test: chmod a+x ./runtest.sh; ./runtest.sh
framework: shell
require:
  - binutils
  - elfutils
duration: 10m
extra-summary: /kernel/kdump/analyse-basic
extra-task: /kernel/kdump/analyse-basic
